# A `$` produced by an interpolation never forms `${` with a `{` after it, in
# the text or from another interpolation. Subtle: the result reads `${x}`, yet
# `x` is never interpolated, as interpolations are found in the source only.
#= {result: ['${x}', '${x}'], inputs: {dollar: '$', brace: '{'}}
[$'${dollar}{x}', $'${dollar}${brace}x}']
